  "scope": "Prospectively reserved five-drive comparison of two software versions using exactly the same 13 ordinary Edge sessions per build. The original source photographs were used previously in project studies; T01 through T03 share previously referenced landmarks. The study isolates newly frozen descriptions and conservative target regions. It supplies no independent human or field permission assessment.",
