  "method": "Each natural sentence, centre/aisle tap and intended interior tap starts in a fresh normal browser session on 8775. The browser checks displayed-source SHA-256 before submission. The corrected plan hash predates both runs. The 15-second visible deadline distinguishes an ordinary completed clarification from an operational timeout. Each point must lie inside the frozen region. A selectable option, direct model proposal, passenger mark and complete bay extent are distinct results.",
  "access_readback": {
    "plan_sha256": "78f8f4d665fa343ec3ee4d784df2876bdc98eeea1bfb32b9486b21ddb2226cd5",
